  "description": "Boserich is a modern elegant serif typeface designed to bring a luxurious and high-fashion feel into your creative projects. Inspired by editorial magazines, luxury branding, and contemporary fashion aesthetics, this font blends classic serif structure with stylish modern details.\nWith its high contrast strokes, refined curves, and distinctive ligatures, Boserich creates a strong visual presence while still maintaining readability. The unique character shapes especially in letters like A, g, and R add a sophisticated personality that stands out effortlessly.\nThis font comes in multiple weights (Thin, Regular, and Bold), giving you the flexibility to create everything from delicate headlines to bold statement typography.\nPerfect For\n– Fashion branding & luxury logos\n– Magazine layouts & editorials\n– Instagram & social media content\n– Beauty & skincare branding\n– Wedding invitations\n– Packaging design\n– High-end typography projects\nFeatures:\n– A – Z set (Uppercase & Lowercase)\n– Number\n– Punctuation\n– Alternates\n– Ligatures\n– Multilingual\n– Boserich Characters Map\nFile type:\n– Boserich Thin (OTF, TTF)\n– Boserich Regular (OTF, TTF)\n– Boserich Bold (OTF, TTF)",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Boserich is a modern elegant serif typeface designed to bring a luxurious and high-fashion feel into your creative projects. Inspired by editorial magazines, luxury branding, and contemporary fashion aesthetics, this font blends classic serif structure with stylish modern details.<br>\nWith its high contrast strokes, refined curves, and distinctive ligatures, Boserich creates a strong visual presence while still maintaining readability. The unique character shapes especially in letters like A, g, and R add a sophisticated personality that stands out effortlessly.<br>\nThis font comes in multiple weights (Thin, Regular, and Bold), giving you the flexibility to create everything from delicate headlines to bold statement typography.</p>\n<p>Perfect For<br>\n– Fashion branding &amp; luxury logos<br>\n– Magazine layouts &amp; editorials<br>\n– Instagram &amp; social media content<br>\n– Beauty &amp; skincare branding<br>\n– Wedding invitations<br>\n– Packaging design<br>\n– High-end typography projects</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n– A – Z set (Uppercase &amp; Lowercase)<br>\n– Number<br>\n– Punctuation<br>\n– Alternates<br>\n– Ligatures<br>\n– Multilingual<br>\n– Boserich Characters Map</p>\n<p>File type:<br>\n– Boserich Thin (OTF, TTF)<br>\n– Boserich Regular (OTF, TTF)<br>\n– Boserich Bold (OTF, TTF)</p>",
